{"reviewId": "35067809_86Nov9iQI", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "经济顶点： 中国的固定资产投资高点出现在 2004年（经济最热的时候）。\n\n价格顶点： 资源品价格（石油、有色）最疯狂的牛市冲击发生在 2007年—2008年。\n\n时间差： 又是4年！\n\n这说明了什么？ 说明2004年当你看到中国投资数据下滑时，如果你这就去空石油，你会被后面4年的暴涨拉爆仓。因为资源价格的冲击是一个“积累的结果”，而不是对当下数据的即时反应。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "可以看到，中国一次能源消费增速高点是在2004年，正好是中国固定资产投资的高点，随后增速开始回落，但资源品价格牛市的冲击发生在2007—2008年，恰好也在4年之后（见图1-15）​。", "range": "15394-15485", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "35067809_86Nov9iQI", "userVid": 35067809, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770656192, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 35067809, "name": "D", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/SgKic6weIhq6zQwaVOXHrj27y3w0PE4XK3bv187iaRhAUMWBl4rzF0YKoSY9W7GYHoWhDcKJHffF0JCP4FZmD3sCo58rxZdRsrGveXjC0XBHY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 17784386, "name": "zbyblue", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/K1YM9IhnDzzoKGC6FrJ5icBoqIMeRgCA4vzjx0CiaLf2Hc1pz89MEFVlb9joHicVxjkuN2UIYbpeTY1dWyDx2MDHYId7QceMttlEV843xoVaAY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "zbyblue", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}